<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-14782] .NET: If bash not installed on pod, ignite fails to start</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-14782</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If bash is not installed, you get the following exception on startup:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-c#&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;System&lt;/span&gt;.TypeInitializationException: The type initializer &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;Apache.Ignite.Core.Impl.Unmanaged.Jni.JvmDll&apos;&lt;/span&gt; threw an exception.
 ---&amp;gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;System&lt;/span&gt;.TypeInitializationException: The type initializer &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;Apache.Ignite.Core.Impl.Unmanaged.Os&apos;&lt;/span&gt; threw an exception.
 ---&amp;gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;System&lt;/span&gt;.ComponentModel.Win32Exception (2): No such file or directory
   at &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;System&lt;/span&gt;.Diagnostics.Process.ForkAndExecProcess(&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; filename, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;[] argv, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;[] envp, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; cwd, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Boolean&lt;/span&gt; redirectStdin, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Boolean&lt;/span&gt; redirectStdout, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Boolean&lt;/span&gt; redirectStderr, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Boolean&lt;/span&gt; setCredentials, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;UInt32&lt;/span&gt; userId, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;UInt32&lt;/span&gt; groupId, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;UInt32&lt;/span&gt;[] groups, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Int32&lt;/span&gt;&amp;amp; stdinFd, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Int32&lt;/span&gt;&amp;amp; stdoutFd, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Int32&lt;/span&gt;&amp;amp; stderrFd, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Boolean&lt;/span&gt; usesTerminal, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Boolean&lt;/span&gt; throwOnNoExec)
   at &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;System&lt;/span&gt;.Diagnostics.Process.StartCore(ProcessStartInfo startInfo)
   at &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;System&lt;/span&gt;.Diagnostics.Process.Start()
   at Apache.Ignite.Core.Impl.Shell.Execute(&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; file, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; args)
   at Apache.Ignite.Core.Impl.Shell.BashExecute(&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; args)
   at Apache.Ignite.Core.Impl.Unmanaged.Os..cctor()
   --- End of inner exception stack trace ---
   at Apache.Ignite.Core.Impl.Unmanaged.Os.get_IsWindows()
   at Apache.Ignite.Core.Impl.Unmanaged.Jni.JvmDll..cctor()
   --- End of inner exception stack trace ---
   at Apache.Ignite.Core.Impl.Unmanaged.Jni.JvmDll.Load(&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; configJvmDllPath, ILogger log)
   at Apache.Ignite.Core.Ignition.Start(IgniteConfiguration cfg)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
